# (five INDEPENDENT heavily-biased Born decisions: R; H T H; M per qubit, each reading 1 with
# Born probability ~0.1464, joint all-ones branch p ~ 0.1464^5 ~ 6.7e-5 — the branch a 512-shot
# discovery draw misses with probability ~0.97).  Two adaptations for the port oracle:
#   * a CX-copied ancilla per decision qubit (OUTPUT_QUBITS must be unmeasured), so the port
#     carries the born outcomes: bare certified stabilizer Z_q.Z_anc(q) times born op Z_q gives
#     the port check Z_anc(q) — a certified (x) born-op span decomposition per check;
#   * X_ERROR(0.05) on the ancillas AFTER the copy, so residual plans carry nontrivial prefix
#     Paulis that conjugate the port checks (prefix (x) born composition exercised); the noise
#     never touches a measured record, so decision records stay equal to the raw born coins.
